<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Shared Harvest Hub | Years 6–10 Convergence</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0f172a; --card: #1e293b; --txt: #f8fafc; --primary: #27ae60; --primary-dark: #1e8449;
            --hud: #144d29; --accent: #38bdf8; --muted: #94a3b8; --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            --warn: #f59e0b; --success: #4ade80;
        }
        body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--txt); margin: 0; padding: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 20px auto; background: var(--card); border-radius: 14px; padding: 35px; border: 1px solid var(--border); box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .hud-bar { background: var(--hud); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 20px; margin-bottom: 25px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-weight: bold; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
        h1 { color: #4ade80; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-top: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 15px; }
        h2 { color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 25px; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding-left: 10px; }
        p, label { color: var(--muted); } strong { color: var(--txt); }
        
        .panel { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 25px; margin-top: 20px; }
        
        .comparison-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .comparison-card { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; }
        
        .btn { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; border: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; }
        .btn:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }
        .btn-secondary { background: #334155; }
        .btn-secondary:hover { background: #475569; }

        .stat-highlight { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: bold; color: var(--success); margin: 5px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="hud-bar">
        <span>Shared Harvest Hub</span>
        <div>Campaign Stage: <strong style="color:var(--accent);">Years 6–10 Convergence</strong></div>
    </div>

    <!-- WELCOME / RETROSPECTIVE PANEL -->
    <div class="panel">
        <h1>🌟 Welcome to the Shared Harvest Convergence Hub</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 1.05rem;">
            You have successfully navigated your first 5-year agricultural cycle! Regardless of whether you started on the Cooperative Partnership track or grinded it out on the Independent Solo track, your operational paths now merge. 
        </p>

        <div style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; margin-top: 20px;">
            <h3 style="color:var(--accent); margin-top:0;">📊 Your Playthrough Summary</h3>
            <p id="player-score-summary" style="color: var(--txt); margin-bottom: 0;">
                Loading your stored 5-year results from localStorage...
            </p>
        </div>

        <h2>⚖️ The Side-by-Side Reality: Teamwork vs. Winging It</h2>
        <div class="comparison-grid">
            <div class="comparison-card">
                <h3 style="color: #4ade80; margin-top:0;">🤝 The Shared Harvest Advantage</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
                    Farmers who leaned into cooperative partnerships benefited from shared bulk equipment, vetted seasonal labor pools, and pre-negotiated B2B distribution. They experienced lower stress, steady compounding growth, and built-in climate risk mitigation.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="comparison-card">
                <h3 style="color: #fbbf24; margin-top:0;">⚡ The Independent Solo Lessons</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
                    Farmers who chose the solo grind discovered immense autonomy and high initial capital ($25k), but battled higher turnover overhead, equipment maintenance fatigue, and unpredictable market swings without co-op backing.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2>🚀 Entering Years 6 through 10: Advanced Scaling</h2>
        <p>
            With your foundation established, Years 6–10 introduce regional land stewardship, advanced automated internet marketing funnels, and bulk cooperative distribution contracts across Linn County.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- NAVIGATION / ACTION -->
    <div style="margin-top: 30px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px;">
        <a href="acreage-path-select.html" class="btn btn-secondary">&larr; Replay Years 1–5 (Choose Different Track)</a>
        <button class="btn" onclick="alert('Years 6–10 Advanced Expansion modules are ready for deployment!')">Enter Years 6–10 Operations →</button>
    </div>

</div>

<script>
    // Pull saved game state if available from the 1-5 simulators
    window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
        const savedState = localStorage.getItem('farmGameState');
        const summaryBox = document.getElementById('player-score-summary');
        
        if (savedState) {
            const data = JSON.parse(savedState);
            summaryBox.innerHTML = `
                You completed Years 1–5 with an ending cash position of <strong style="color:var(--success);">$${Math.round(data.cash || 0).toLocaleString()}</strong> 
                (${data.track === 'coop' ? 'Cooperative Partnership Track' : 'Independent Solo Track'}). 
                Your experience directly informs your leadership role in the shared hub for Years 6–10.
            `;
        } else {
            summaryBox.innerHTML = `You arrived at the Hub! (Tip: Play through either the Cooperative or Independent simulator to record your specific financial history here).`;
        }
    });
</script>

</body>
</html>
